triage: fix_game: The tests correctly expect each player to be offered the bids 0, 1, 2 and 3 and to have the chosen value recorded in `bid`. In the game file, the bid step never offered those options (not even 0), so every seat's bid stayed at the default 0 and the bid-0 scoring followed from that.
