triage: fix_game: The bid poll did not offer every seat the options 0 to 3. Seat 1's rule matched, but seats 2 and 3 were never offered option 3 and fell back to the default 0, so seat 2's bid of 3 could not be entered. The rules require one simultaneous poll in which every player chooses from bid_min to bid_max, so the game file is at fault.
