triage: fix_game: The rules say the bid poll offers exactly 0, 1, 2 and 3, and the tests rightly answer 3 whenever that option is offered. The game never offered 3 to any seat, so every bid fell back to the default 0 (seat 2's expected bid of 3 came out as 0), which means the file builds the bid options wrongly.
